      "prompt_hash": "bb8b4f7f1b675972",
      "draft": "Nicco held out the leather boots, the item still warm from the brief contact. \"You'll need them more than me,\" he told the guard captain.\n\nDoran Hale looked down at the offering with a faint frown, his expression shifting from surprise to skepticism. The officer crossed his arms, his armor clinking softly with the movement, and made no move to take the boots back. \"Keep them,\" Hale said, his tone leaving no room for argument. \"I have a budget for gear. You look like you've been walking a long road, and I’d rather not see a citizen lose their toes to the cold.\" He gestured toward the boots in Nicco's hands. \"Don't be proud about it; just take the help.\"",
